s privados, el tribunal no respalda la parte del interés que supere 4 veces el LPR a un año vigente al celebrarse el contrato, sustituyendo el esquema anterior de dos líneas 24%/36% y tres zonas (nacional, desde agosto de 2020)"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Fuentes originales"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["全国人大常委会 (2007). 劳动合同法（主席令第六十五号，第九、八十四条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2007/content_711013.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2007/content_711013.htm"]},"；劳动保障部 (2007). 就业服务与就业管理规定（劳动保障部令第 28 号，第十四、五十五、五十八条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/2022-11/28/content_5711307.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/2022-11/28/content_5711307.htm"]},"；人力资源社会保障部等五部门 (2026). 警惕「招转培」「培训贷」等风险提示. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://chinajob.mohrss.gov.cn/h5/c/2026-05-18/543038.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://chinajob.mohrss.gov.cn/h5/c/2026-05-18/543038.shtml"]},"；国务院 (2005). 禁止传销条例（国务院令第 444 号，第二、七、二十四条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2005/content_80604.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2005/content_80604.htm"]},"；最高人民法院 (2020). 关于修改《关于审理民间借贷案件适用法律若干问题的规定》的决定（法释〔2020〕6 号，第二十六条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.court.gov.cn/fabu/xiangqing/249031.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.court.gov.cn/fabu/xiangqing/249031.html"]},"；最高人民法院 (2020). 民间借贷利率司法保护上限调整为「一年期 LPR 的 4 倍」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.court.gov.cn/zixun/xiangqing/249051.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.court.gov.cn/zixun/xiangqing/249051.html"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"h